<!--
  Centralised UI strings in :core:designsystem.

  Rationale: every feature module (map/search/routing/tracking/tracks/regions) already
  depends on :core:designsystem for theme/components, so this is the one place where
  shared user-visible strings live without creating a circular dependency on :app.
  :app keeps only app_name, navigation labels, permission flows and attribution —
  strings that only the shell needs.

  Supported UI locales in v2: en (default), ru, es.
-->
